This product includes data derived from others:

src/datascout/data/country_to_mc_sources.json
  Lists of news-source domains per country, taken from the country collections of the
  Media Cloud source directory (https://www.mediacloud.org/), an open-source project for
  media research. The domains are used only to restrict searches to those sources.

src/datascout/data/country_to_code.json
  Country names mapped to the two-letter country codes accepted by Google Search's "gl"
  parameter.

examples/data/
  Data points collected from public web pages; each row links to its source page.
